title: AD DNS Record With Marshaled Target Info (CVE-2025-33073)
id: 550d5e03-b7a9-42ee-82cb-cbc411b7f8e4
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects creation or modification of an Active Directory-integrated DNS record whose
    name contains the marshaled CREDENTIAL_TARGET_INFORMATION string used to set up
    NTLM/Kerberos reflection, the preparation step for CVE-2025-33073 privilege
    escalation. Requires directory service auditing on the DNS zone containers.
references:
    - https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-33073
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026-08-23
modified: 2026-11-03
tags:
    - attack.privilege-escalation
    - attack.t1068
    - attack.credential-access
    - attack.t1557.001
    - cve.2025-33073
logsource:
    product: windows
    service: security
    definition: 'Requirements: Audit Directory Service Changes enabled, with a SACL on the AD-integrated DNS zone containers'
detection:
    selection:
        EventID:
            - 5136
            - 5137
        ObjectClass: 'dnsNode'
        ObjectDN|contains: '1UWhRCAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwbEAYBAAAA'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Unlikely; this marshaled string has no legitimate use in DNS record names
level: high

---
title: Windows Event Log, Prefetch, or PowerShell History Clearing
id: 5fe03799-502a-44ca-bed3-1301dbd6e999
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects command-line clearing of Windows event logs, prefetch files, or PowerShell
    command history, matching The Gentlemen's pre-encryption anti-forensic cleanup.
references:
    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/the-gentlemen-ransomware-defense-evasion-ttps
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026-08-23
modified: 2026-11-03
tags:
    - attack.defense-evasion
    - attack.t1070.001
    - attack.t1070.003
    - attack.t1070.004
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_wevtutil_img:
        Image|endswith: '\wevtutil.exe'
    selection_wevtutil_cmd:
        CommandLine|contains:
            - ' cl '
            - ' clear-log '
    selection_ps_clear:
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'Clear-EventLog'
            - 'Remove-EventLog'
    selection_prefetch_path:
        CommandLine|contains: '\Windows\Prefetch'
    selection_prefetch_cmd:
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'del '
            - 'Remove-Item'
            - 'erase '
    selection_psreadline:
        CommandLine|contains: 'ConsoleHost_history.txt'
    condition: (selection_wevtutil_img and selection_wevtutil_cmd) or selection_ps_clear or (selection_prefetch_path and selection_prefetch_cmd) or selection_psreadline
falsepositives:
    - Scripted log rotation or IT maintenance jobs; tune by parent process or user
level: high

