title: Privileged Group and Domain Trust Enumeration via Native Tools
id: 07f8c3c6-db0c-46c5-b43f-5b97e15305e7
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects built-in Windows tools (net, nltest, dsquery) enumerating privileged groups,
    domain controllers, or domain trusts, matching The Gentlemen's living-off-the-land
    reconnaissance ahead of ransomware deployment.
references:
    - https://redpiranha.net/news/the-gentlemen-ransomware-analysis
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026-08-23
modified: 2026-11-03
tags:
    - attack.discovery
    - attack.t1069.002
    - attack.t1482
    - attack.t1018
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_img:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\net.exe'
            - '\net1.exe'
            - '\nltest.exe'
            - '\dsquery.exe'
    selection_cmd:
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'domain admins'
            - 'enterprise admins'
            - '/domain_trusts'
            - '/dclist'
    condition: selection_img and selection_cmd
falsepositives:
    - Routine administrative enumeration by IT or help desk staff
level: low
